cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PeriFEATO in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PeriFEATO: Peridigm + FEA + Topology Optimization"
abstract: >-
  A dual-physics shell thickness optimization framework coupling
  finite element analysis (FEA) with peridynamic fracture simulation
  (Peridigm). PeriFEATO iteratively designs shell structures that
  satisfy both stress constraints and fracture performance targets,
  supporting seven optimization algorithms (FSD-G, FSD-GA, OC, MMA,
  BO, PGD, COBYLA).
authors:
  - family-names: Nakamura
    given-names: Matthew
    affiliation: "Applied Research Laboratory, University of Hawaii at Manoa"
repository-code: "https://github.com/nanosystemslab/PeriFEATO"
url: "https://github.com/nanosystemslab/PeriFEATO"
license: GPL-3.0
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - topology-optimization
  - finite-element-analysis
  - peridynamics
  - fracture-mechanics
  - shell-structures
  - dolfinx
  - peridigm
